<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-St George appoints Reaney to board.</title>
<headline>RTRS-St George appoints Reaney to board.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>St George Bank on Tuesday said former National Foods Ltd managing director Graham Reaney has been appointed to the board.</p>
<p>St George chairman Frank Conroy said Reaney had extensive executive and commercial experience in the food, consumer products and resource industries. Reaney is also on the board of The Australian Gas Light Co.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
